WorldNativeComposition.lakesideFallback: Voice Bot's [QF_LAKE] logs stay (log only) + one
[QF_LAKE] {event:'lakeside-fallback',stage,reason,island} line; the lakeside journey is dropped
(new WorldFlow.abandonLakesideJourney via commands(): returnToIsland, stable island, restore - no
'旅程暂时受阻' retry state), and the HUD gets LAKESIDE_LOAD_FAILED -> only the toast
「湖畔暂时没准备好，先回小岛吧」. cancelled/paused/busy stay soft (normal pause/resume UI).
Lake ambience load failure stays log-only (sea waves keep playing), no toast.
Test: tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_fallback.cjs (suite: lakeside-fallback); load-failure test follows.
